#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:4
msgid "通用检测模型(快)"
msgstr "Universal detection model (fast)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:9
msgid ""
"这是一个轻量、加速推理的通用目标检测模型模板，适用于简单物体检测场景。本页为模型说明模板，包含输入/输出定义、示例场景、配置参数说明与推荐使用场景。"
msgstr ""
"This is a lightweight, accelerated inference universal target detection "
"model template, suitable for simple object detection scenarios.This page is "
"a model description template, including input/output definitions, example "
"scenarios, configuration parameter descriptions, and recommended usage "
"scenarios."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:12
msgid "输入/输出"
msgstr "input/output"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:14
msgid "输入（Input）:"
msgstr "Input:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:15
msgid "图像（单帧）（来自上游节点或工作流输入）"
msgstr "Image (single frame) (from upstream node or workflow input)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:17
msgid "输出（Output）:"
msgstr "Output:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:18
msgid "基于用户提示词的检测结果，包含检测到的物体类别、置信度和边界框信息。。"
msgstr ""
"Detection results based on user prompt words include detected object "
"categories, confidence levels, and bounding box information.."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:21
msgid "场景示例"
msgstr "Scenario example"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:25
msgid "配置参数详解"
msgstr "Detailed explanation of configuration parameters"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:27
msgid "下面列出模板中常见的配置参数与含义，实际字段名请与项目中的配置文件或推理服务对齐。"
msgstr ""
"Common configuration parameters and their meanings in the template are "
"listed below. Please align the actual field names with the configuration "
"file or inference service in the project."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:32
msgid "参数"
msgstr "parameter"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:33
msgid "说明"
msgstr "illustrate"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:34
msgid "示例/ ``默认值``"
msgstr "Example/``DefaultValue``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:35
msgid "节点名称"
msgstr "Node name"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:36
msgid "自定义该节点的名称，用于标识工作流中的该步骤。无需特意编辑，保持默认即可。"
msgstr ""
"Customize the name of the node to identify the step in the workflow.No "
"special editing is required, just keep the default."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:37
msgid "``general_detection_model_fast_1``"
msgstr "``general_detection_model_fast_1``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:38
msgid "备注"
msgstr "Remark"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:39
msgid "可选的备注信息，用于描述该步骤的用途。"
msgstr "Optional remarks describing the purpose of this step."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:40
msgid "``留空``"
msgstr "``leave blank``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:41
msgid "图像"
msgstr "image"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:42
msgid "指定输入图像的来源，可以是上游节点的输出或工作流的输入参数。"
msgstr ""
"Specifies the source of the input image, which can be the output of an "
"upstream node or an input parameter of a workflow."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:43
msgid "``input image``"
msgstr "``input image``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:44
msgid "检测分类"
msgstr "Detection classification"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:45
msgid "自定义检测类别的英文提示词，在 ``[\"  \"]`` 中输入需要检测的物体类别，多个类别用逗号分隔。"
msgstr ""
"To customize the English prompt word of the detection category, enter the "
"object category to be detected in ``[\" \"]``. Multiple categories are "
"separated by commas."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:46
msgid "**[\"box\", \"bottle\", \"chair\"]**"
msgstr "**[\"box\", \"bottle\", \"chair\"]**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:47
msgid "置信度阈值"
msgstr "confidence threshold"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:48
msgid "设置检测结果的置信度阈值，范围为0到1。低于该阈值的检测结果将被过滤掉。"
msgstr ""
"Set the confidence threshold of the detection result, ranging from 0 to "
"1.Detection results below this threshold will be filtered out."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:49
msgid "**0.3**"
msgstr "**0.3**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:50
msgid "标签置信度阈值"
msgstr "Label confidence threshold"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:51
msgid "为每个标签单独设置置信度阈值，使用JSON格式输入。"
msgstr ""
"Set the confidence threshold individually for each label, using JSON format "
"input."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:52
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**{\"car\": 0.5, \"person\": 0.7}**"
msgstr "**{\"car\": 0.5, \"person\": 0.7}**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:53
msgid "推理精度"
msgstr "Reasoning accuracy"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:54
msgid "选择推理模式，FP32（32位浮点）更准确，FP16（16位）更快但精度略低。"
msgstr ""
"Select the inference mode, FP32 (32-bit floating point) is more accurate, "
"FP16 (16-bit) is faster but slightly less accurate."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:55
msgid "``FP32``"
msgstr "``FP32``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:56
msgid "图像分辨率"
msgstr "Image resolution"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:57
msgid "推理时的输入图像分辨率。更高的分辨率对小目标检测更准确,但速度更慢且显存占用更大。"
msgstr ""
"Input image resolution during inference.Higher resolution is more accurate "
"for small target detection, but is slower and takes up more video memory."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_detection_fast.rst:58
msgid "``640``"
msgstr "``640``"
